"OFTEN PATRICIA MARTIN SAT HERE WITH GORDON;
ENCHANTED BY THE SETTING SUN, THE SHIPS RIDING AT ANCHOR,
AND THE MYSTERIES BEYOND THE HORIZON."

In fond loving memory of EUROS Jones of Mydroilyn & Mumbles
(Feb 1931 - May 2017)
A wonderful gentleman & beloved husband of Elsie; father of Andrew & Angela;
father-in-law to Paul & Ashy; "gramps" to Ben, Vicky, Cassi, Max & James;
& great grandfather to Sophia, Ella & Hannah......
You will forever remain our Sunshine...... xxx

In memory of Donna "GG" Logan
Lover of nature, children, and play;
thank you for your devotion to community.

Verdens beste Mamma, Pappa og besteforeldre;
Helle og Jan Petter
40 års bryllupsdag- bravo!

Meanwhile these three remain:
faith, hope and love;
and the greatest of these is love.

In memory of
Bob Stone and Des Broom
from their friends in Pringy (France)

Life is a great big canvas;
throw all the paint you can at
D.J.E. Houtvast 1979-2018
